    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[0]'
      value: By the way, with some practise
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[1]'
      value: you should be able to <color=#00E2FB>hold</color> on to the <color=#00E2FB>Ladder</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'You don''t have to let yourself <color=#00E2FB>fall down</color> all
        the time '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[3]'
      value: while <color=#00E2FB>climbing</color>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[4]'
      value: <color=yellow>Press </color></i><color=red>SHIFT</color><color=yellow>
        while  </color><color=red>CLIMBING</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[5]'
      value: <color=yellow>to </color><color=red>STAY PUT</color><color=yellow>.</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[6]'
      value: <color=yellow>You can still move </color><color=red>UP AND DOWN</color><color=yellow>
        the </color><color=#00E2FB>Ladder</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[7]'
      value: <color=yellow>while </color></i><color=red>HOLDING SHIFT</color><color=yellow>.</color>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[8]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[9]'
      value: It will help you with the <color=#00E2FB>Ghosts</color> you encounter.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[10]'
      value: Some of the Spirits stayed true to themselves.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[11]'
      value: Like the <color=#00E2FB>Souls</color> of the <color=#00E2FB>Animals</color>
        helping you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[12]'
      value: Some stayed neutral. Like many plants.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[13]'
      value: But some spirits...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[14]'
      value: It makes me sad to see them turn into these evil corrupted beings.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[15]'
      value: Please don't hurt them. They are merely lost.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[16]'
      value: 'When the <color=#00E2FB>Light</color> touches them, '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[17]'
      value: with some practise
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[18]'
      value: 'When they experience peace, even if just for a moment, '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[19]'
      value: you can slip past them without being harmed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7786807045612242666, guid: 25562f04acd008843b8ce7a876cbafb7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'messageArray.Array.data[20]'
      value: And you help them to not forget themselves forever.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
